g> wrote:
>
> Replace the remaining uses of the legacy vm_flags_t flags in the rmap log=
ic
> with vma_flags_t values.
>
> No functional change intended.
>
> Signed-off-by: Lorenzo Stoakes (ARM) <ljs@kernel.org>
